# Legacy paths → canonical solution pages.
# Product domains (g8deck.com, g8stack.com, g8desk.com, g8id.com, gatherhub.app, waumail.my,
# bliptrace.com, warung.my, janesweeper.g8deck.com, academy.devhub.my) deliberately DO NOT redirect inward — each
# product has its own detail page here that links OUT to its live site.

# Route renamed /products → /our-solutions; keep old links and indexed URLs alive.
/products           /our-solutions          301!
/products/*         /our-solutions/:splat   301!

# Convenience alias — @astrojs/sitemap emits sitemap-index.xml; robots.txt points
# there, but anyone typing the conventional name still lands on it.
/sitemap.xml        /sitemap-index.xml      301!
